'''Sulfur''' is a [[block]] that naturally generates in [[sulfur caves]] alongside [[cinnabar]], in [[sulfur pool]]s, and as part of [[sulfur spring]]s.

== Obtaining ==
=== Breaking ===
Sulfur drops as an item if mined by any [[pickaxe]]. If mined without a pickaxe, it drops nothing.
{{Breaking row|Sulfur|Pickaxe|Wood|horizontal=1}}

=== Natural generation ===
Sulfur generates throughout sulfur caves and as part of sulfur springs.

