== Usage ==
=== Crafting ingredient ===
Sulfur can be [[craft]]ed into several decorative variants.
{{Crafting usage}}

=== Stonecutting ingredient ===
{{Stonecutting
|showname=1
|Sulfur
|Sulfur Slab, 2; Sulfur Stairs; Sulfur Wall; Polished Sulfur; Polished Sulfur Slab, 2; Polished Sulfur Stairs; Polished Sulfur Wall; Sulfur Bricks; Sulfur Brick Slab, 2; Sulfur Brick Stairs; Sulfur Brick Wall; Chiseled Sulfur
|foot=1
}}

=== Sulfur cube ===
[[Sulfur cube]]s have the ability to absorb sulfur, either through picking it up or being interacted with it. This provides the regular/football effect to the mob when hitting it.

